Day 24 – Startup Business Strategy & Sustainability Report
Overview
This project converts a startup blueprint into a comprehensive business strategy report to determine whether the startup has the potential to become a sustainable business.
What's Included
- Startup Summary
- Customer & MVP Analysis
- Value Proposition
- Revenue & Pricing Strategy
- Business Model Canvas
- Go-To-Market (GTM) Strategy
- Customer Acquisition Plan
- First 100 Users Roadmap
- Competitive Position & Moat
- Reverse SWOT Analysis
- Investor One-Liner
- 30-Second Founder Pitch
- Founder Action Sheet
- Investment Scorecard
- HTML/SVG Visual Dashboard
- PDF-Ready Professional Report
Key Focus Areas
- Revenue over vanity metrics
- Distribution over features
- Evidence over assumptions
- Practical execution over theory
Outcome
The final report provides founders with a clear roadmap to validate assumptions, improve execution, strengthen their business model, and make better investment and growth decisions
